🔐 4. Agent — Security Auditing

This is where I'd make the project stand out.

Firewall
Priority	Task
🔴 High	Detect active firewall technology
🔴 High	Determine firewall status
🟡 Medium	Collect firewall rules
🟡 Medium	Detect iptables/nftables/ufw/firewalld configuration
Open Ports
Priority	Task
🔴 High	Discover listening TCP/UDP ports
🔴 High	Identify processes associated with listening ports
🔴 High	Identify common network services
🟡 Medium	Flag potentially unexpected open ports
🟡 Medium	Create configurable monitored-port list

I'd include at least:

22    SSH
21    FTP
23    Telnet
25    SMTP
53    DNS
80    HTTP
110   POP3
139   NetBIOS
143   IMAP
443   HTTPS
445   SMB
3389  RDP
5432  PostgreSQL
3306  MySQL
5900  VNC
6379  Redis

You don't necessarily need to scan these ports manually—the agent can discover all listening ports and then identify the important ones.

